/*
  EndpointSidebar.strings
  TeslaSync — P4 feature view · 0029 · EndpointSidebar (Apple)

  The P1/S10 i18n catalog contribution for this surface. Every key the native
  EndpointSidebar resolves (table "EndpointSidebar") lives here with its web
  t(key, default) English value. These entries fold into the app
  Localizable.xcstrings master catalog at integration time; they are kept in a
  per-surface table so each parallel surface prompt owns its own strings without
  editing the shared catalog (parallel-unsafe across the concurrent slots).

  The first three keys are the EXACT strings extracted from the web source
  (features/admin/components/EndpointSidebar.tsx). The remaining keys back the
  native-only chrome (freshness, seam-driven states, accessibility) that the web
  parent page owns.
*/

